WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.610
Comic Girls

00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:10.230
Caution

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:16.910
Beautiful Fukushima

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:42.390
Huh? I got the worst results on the survey?

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.100
The story is boring

00:00:42.390 --> 00:00:44.100
Yes, you did.

00:00:44.100 --> 00:00:47.040
The readers' comments include, 
"The art sucks,"

00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.210
"The characters do nothing for me,"

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.420
"The story is boring," etc.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:50.940
I've never seen such an unrealistic
high school girl in my life.

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:50.940
Ochiba Girls

00:00:50.320 --> 00:00:50.940
High School Girlz

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:54.650
Also, "I've never seen such an 
unrealistic high school girl in my life.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:51.650
Never

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:57.910
The author should try to look at 
reality a little more," apparently.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:09.750
Amisawa-san

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:06.150
<i>Hello?</i>

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:07.400
<i>Are you listening?</i>

00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.960
<i>Hello? Kaos-sensei?</i>

00:01:11.390 --> 00:01:13.610
But I'm a high school girl...

00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.780
<i>There's actually more.</i>

00:01:17.780 --> 00:01:19.700
<i>"The title sucks."</i>

00:01:19.700 --> 00:01:21.410
<i>"The story's predictable."</i>

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:24.770
I'm sorry my manga is so crappy...

00:01:21.780 --> 00:01:24.770
<i>"The protagonist is unrelatable."</i>

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.270
<i>"It's honestly not that great."</i>

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:28.770
Thank you for everything...

00:01:28.770 --> 00:01:30.400
Hey, wait!

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:37.620
<i>This girl is too easily hurt...</i>

00:01:37.620 --> 00:01:40.330
<i>But she has some unique talent.</i>

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:43.200
<i>She won't last on her own, though.</i>

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:46.200
<i>Kaos-sensei,</i>

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:50.100
<i>if you're interested...</i>

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.840
Bunhousha
Female Manga Artist Dorms

00:01:53.710 --> 00:01:54.840
Dorm Looking for applicants!!

00:01:56.200 --> 00:01:57.840
A female manga artist dorm?

00:01:57.840 --> 00:01:58.810
Yes.

00:01:58.810 --> 00:02:01.300
You're a little too freewheeling,

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:04.700
so I want you to meet some other 
manga artists to draw inspiration from.

00:02:05.350 --> 00:02:08.600
You don't have to reply immediately, 
but I'd like you to think on it.

00:02:09.790 --> 00:02:11.100
I'll go!

00:02:11.100 --> 00:02:13.280
Er, could you think about it a little?

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.900
I'll go! Being surrounded by other 
manga artists sounds fun!

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:18.610
But we need your parents' approval, too...

00:02:19.090 --> 00:02:21.190
Mom? I need to ask you something!

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.080
"Wow, that seems fun. 
Sure, why not?" is what she said.

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.070
I see...

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:33.000
Just so you know, you'll 
have more pages next time.

00:02:30.800 --> 00:02:34.040
Your surveys are doing well, 
so keep up the good work.

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.820
I'm glad my series got serialized,

00:02:43.820 --> 00:02:46.230
but working on that and going 
to school is pretty rough.

00:02:46.230 --> 00:02:47.600
I need some healing.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:48.950
You poor thing.

00:02:48.950 --> 00:02:52.120
I guess you're just going to age 
before the rest of us, Rukki.

00:02:52.120 --> 00:02:54.320
Like you can talk, Tsu-chan.

00:02:54.800 --> 00:02:59.530
I'm happy with just being able 
to draw manga every day.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:09.480
Keep up that stoicism of yours, 
and you're going to turn into a boy.

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.930
I think I might be okay with that.

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:15.170
No! We won't be able to be as close, then.

00:03:13.980 --> 00:03:15.170
That's your issue?

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:22.600
Oh, welcome back.

00:03:22.600 --> 00:03:24.250
We're back.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.940
We're back, ma'am.

00:03:25.940 --> 00:03:29.430
By the way, we're getting two new kids next 
week, so I hope you'll look after them.

00:03:29.710 --> 00:03:30.900
Okay.

00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:32.260
They're newbies.

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:34.010
New people, huh?

00:03:34.010 --> 00:03:35.400
I wonder what they're like.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.700
A female manga artist dorm...

00:03:45.150 --> 00:03:47.420
It has such a nice ring to it.

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.790
Female Manga Artist Dorm 

00:03:50.300 --> 00:03:51.960
But I'm so nervous!

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.670
Kaos Theater Episode 1

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:56.600
<i>Hey, your nails are so cute!</i>

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:58.620
<i>You noticed?</i>

00:03:58.620 --> 00:04:00.550
<i>Your bracelet's cute, too!</i>

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:03.810
<i>The accessories at this shop are so cheap.</i>

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.550
<i>Aw, I wanna go.</i>

00:04:05.780 --> 00:04:07.050
<i>Me, too.</i>

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:10.280
There's no way I could get 
into that conversation!

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.800
Or, since it's a manga artist dorm,

00:04:16.800 --> 00:04:19.280
there might be a lot of 
really intense people...

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.780
Kaos Theater Episode 2

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:24.280
<i>Are you the noob?</i>

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:29.290
<i>Sorry, but you have to have a serialized 
manga to be able to use this salon.</i>

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:32.290
<i>Why not clean up the rejected 
manuscripts up in your room?</i>

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.600
I'm sorry...

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.460
Wait, wait, wait.

00:04:38.930 --> 00:04:41.200
They all love drawing manga,

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.420
so maybe they're not that different from me.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.930
Kaos Theater Episode 3

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:48.240
<i>Another rejection.</i>

00:04:48.240 --> 00:04:49.850
<i>I'm just...</i>

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.440
<i>I can't.</i>

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.510
Manga Sanctuary
Bunhousha

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.510
Manga Time

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.510
The editorial department is so close.

00:05:28.900 --> 00:05:32.000
Though it's still a long way away for me...

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:33.390
But...

00:05:36.800 --> 00:05:39.730
I-I have to do my best.

00:05:42.690 --> 00:05:44.900
<i>I want to continue being a manga artist.</i>

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:59.850
Is this it?

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:04.400
What am I going to do if 
they don't allow newbies in?

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:08.490
Oh? What's the matter, dear?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:13.580
Are you lost?

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:17.010
N-No. Is this Bunhousha's...

00:06:17.010 --> 00:06:18.600
Are you a fan?

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.920
You can't just come in here like that.

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:21.920
No...

00:06:30.410 --> 00:06:34.480
Sorry, I heard that a high 
school girl was coming.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:37.210
I know there are a lot of 
young manga artists lately,

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:39.670
but I guess they let grade schoolers in, too.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.330
I'm in high school—

00:06:41.330 --> 00:06:44.440
There are some girls here who 
already have serialized series,

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:46.350
so do your best.

00:06:46.350 --> 00:06:51.080
The future must be bright for you if they 
picked you when you're still in grade school.

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:53.470
But I'm in high school...

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:56.930
The fact that this place is 
so old must've surprised you.

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.890
They've done some work on 
it so the rooms are nice,

00:07:00.260 --> 00:07:03.180
but they're planning to remodel 
the whole place in about a year.

00:07:03.180 --> 00:07:05.910
You might be the last girl we get.

00:07:05.910 --> 00:07:07.510
I see...

00:07:07.510 --> 00:07:10.290
Okay, here's your room.

00:07:11.390 --> 00:07:12.490
Do your best.

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:14.650
Thank you!

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.950
<i>Someone's lazing around in there!</i>

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:22.400
S-Someone's in here!

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:23.830
Yes, you'll be sharing the room.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.250
Sharing?

00:07:26.440 --> 00:07:27.620
<i>No one told me that!</i>

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.050
<i>I'm going to be sharing a room with someone?</i>

00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:33.650
I'm Koyume. I draw shojo manga.

00:07:33.650 --> 00:07:34.510
Nice to meet you.

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:37.570
I'm sorry to disturb you!

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:38.920
No worries!

00:07:38.920 --> 00:07:40.340
I just came here today, too.

00:07:40.340 --> 00:07:41.610
But you've already settled in!

00:07:41.990 --> 00:07:43.100
What's your name?

00:07:43.490 --> 00:07:45.900
I-I'm Kaoruko Moeta.

00:07:45.900 --> 00:07:48.860
My pen name is Kaos, 
and I draw 4-panel manga.

00:07:48.860 --> 00:07:50.680
Kaos-chan, huh?

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.070
You're so cute and small.

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:53.310
Want a doughnut?

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:57.010
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:07:57.010 --> 00:07:58.080
Do you not like donuts?

00:07:58.210 --> 00:07:59.700
No!

00:07:59.700 --> 00:08:00.480
Um...

00:08:01.080 --> 00:08:03.830
It's just that I've never had anyone 
talk to me like this before.

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:09.600
Before I eat this doughnut,

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.300
I'm going to draw it 10,000 
times so I never forget it.

00:08:13.700 --> 00:08:15.760
You're so adorable!

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:19.970
But my physique doesn't really 
help with drawing manga.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:21.910
Really? Why?

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:25.980
I'm so short that I can't draw 
characters with nice bodies.

00:08:26.180 --> 00:08:28.370
This is plenty cute!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:30.420
But hot bodies are important!

00:08:30.700 --> 00:08:34.980
I wanted to draw a character who's a 
model with the perfect body, but...

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.830
Nice to
meet you.

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.830
Squee!

00:08:34.990 --> 00:08:38.830
Your face
is so
small

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:37.550
I panicked, and it ended up like this.

00:08:37.550 --> 00:08:38.820
You must've <i>really</i> panicked!

00:08:39.090 --> 00:08:42.720
Does your editor comment on 
your drawings, Koyume-san?

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:44.580
They do! Listen to this...

00:08:44.580 --> 00:08:45.580
I want to
experience
a wonderful
relationship!

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:48.240
She's cute!

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:50.000
What's wrong with the drawing?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:53.630
I get compliments about 
girl characters, but...

00:08:54.760 --> 00:08:55.630
Eep!

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:58.390
I'm not really good at drawing boys.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.600
Go out
with me.

00:08:58.600 --> 00:08:59.600
ba-dump

00:09:00.560 --> 00:09:01.410
Scary...

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:03.840
I mean, he's very unique.

00:09:04.650 --> 00:09:07.340
It's fun drawing girls,

00:09:07.340 --> 00:09:10.110
but I can't really get into drawing boys.

00:09:10.230 --> 00:09:13.410
My editor asked me if
I've never been in love before

00:09:13.410 --> 00:09:14.780
and they basically nailed it.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:16.630
Oh, me, too.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.850
"You're not really good at drawing people.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.900
Do you actually have any friends?"

00:09:20.900 --> 00:09:25.290
"Do you talk to anything other than 
cats or bugs?" and stuff like that.

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.920
They basically nailed it.

00:09:26.920 --> 00:09:29.000
You can't even say anything 
when they're exactly right.

00:09:29.000 --> 00:09:31.250
Editors are amazing.

00:09:31.610 --> 00:09:35.760
So they thought I'd be able to learn 
some things if I came to this dorm.

00:09:35.940 --> 00:09:37.260
Me, too! Me, too!

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:41.490
But I'm not sure I'm going to survive...

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:46.680
Hearing you say that is 
making me nervous, too.

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:54.110
Yes?

00:09:55.450 --> 00:09:58.220
Are you the new girls who came today?

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.850
Wh-Wh-Wh-Who are you?

00:09:59.850 --> 00:10:01.620
Huh? I-I live next room...

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:04.490
Are you our manga artist senpais?

00:10:04.490 --> 00:10:05.570
Senpai?!

00:10:05.570 --> 00:10:07.180
You actually survived!

00:10:07.180 --> 00:10:08.690
Senpai!

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:11.170
<i>What's going on with these two?</i>

00:10:13.810 --> 00:10:16.090
My name's Ruki Irokawa.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:18.010
I'm Tsubasa Katsuki.

00:10:18.190 --> 00:10:21.360
You're both manga artists with 
serialized series, right?

00:10:21.360 --> 00:10:23.370
What kind of manga do you draw?

00:10:23.370 --> 00:10:25.990
I draw really passionate shonen manga.

00:10:25.990 --> 00:10:27.130
She draws po—

00:10:27.130 --> 00:10:28.260
Tsu-chan, wait!

00:10:28.260 --> 00:10:30.580
You shouldn't say that in 
front of someone so young!

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:32.580
I-I'm a high school first-year...

00:10:32.580 --> 00:10:34.360
Wait, high school? You don't look it.

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:34.820
Stab

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.820
I-I get that a lot...

00:10:39.780 --> 00:10:41.740
<i>She's so cute and small.</i>

00:10:41.740 --> 00:10:43.740
<i>I bet she'd look cute in a kigurumi.</i>

00:10:43.740 --> 00:10:45.490
<i>Bunny lives in the forest.</i>

00:10:45.490 --> 00:10:47.760
<i>Today, there's a tea party in the forest.</i>

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:50.500
<i>But that's actually a trap 
set up by the wolf...</i>

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.440
Rawr.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.710
No!

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:53.710
Don't go that way! I'm so stupid!

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:59.190
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:55.870
Don't worry about it.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:57.110
She just works too much.

00:10:57.120 --> 00:10:57.920
What?

00:10:58.160 --> 00:11:00.390
Why were you crying, by the way?

00:11:01.520 --> 00:11:03.730
I'm glad that I was able to debut,

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:06.410
but I got nervous that I 
might never get popular...

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:08.920
You think there's no point 
 if you don't get popular?

00:11:08.920 --> 00:11:10.420
Not at all!

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:12.390
I've always loved drawing manga...

00:11:12.390 --> 00:11:13.690
Then who cares?

00:11:14.180 --> 00:11:18.150
I think you just have to keep drawing 
until you get close to your ideal.

00:11:19.920 --> 00:11:21.840
Y-You're right...

00:11:21.840 --> 00:11:27.110
Actually, if you ever want to get close to 
your ideal, then you <i>have</i> to keep drawing!

00:11:27.110 --> 00:11:28.700
She reworded it.

00:11:28.700 --> 00:11:31.290
Now it totally sounds like a tag line.

00:11:32.090 --> 00:11:34.650
Well, we're here to help 
if you ever need us.

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:36.420
That's why we have this dorm.

00:11:37.690 --> 00:11:38.950
Thank you, Senpai!

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.380
Senpai...

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:44.260
They're so cute and innocent!

00:11:44.720 --> 00:11:47.680
You really like that little 
one, don't you, Rukki?

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:49.980
You were really excited, too, Tsu-chan.

00:11:50.110 --> 00:11:52.760
Well, it's probably going to get interesting.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:55.440
If I didn't have a deadline, 
we could've talked longer.

00:11:56.230 --> 00:11:58.400
Senpai, huh?

00:11:59.650 --> 00:12:02.780
We're the same age, so it's a bit weird...

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:05.860
I must've looked really mature...

00:12:12.520 --> 00:12:16.500
<i>Apparently this place isn't as 
terrifying as I thought it'd be.</i>

00:12:16.810 --> 00:12:19.090
<i>Everyone seems really nice.</i>

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:22.500
<i>But I wonder if I'll be able to survive.</i>

00:12:24.700 --> 00:12:27.120
Dinner's ready!

00:12:27.120 --> 00:12:29.390
I'll go get Kaos-chan.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.800
Oh, don't worry about it.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:35.030
Kaos-chan, dinner!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:41.030
Episode 1
"I Got the Worst
Results on the Survey!?"

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:41.030
Convenient,
right?

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:41.030
Blub blub blub blub
(That was too sudden)

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:46.690
Kaos-chan, isn't it great 
that we joined this dorm?

00:12:46.690 --> 00:12:47.440
Yes.

00:12:47.440 --> 00:12:50.410
Our senpais are so cool and nice.

00:12:50.410 --> 00:12:51.450
I know.

00:12:51.450 --> 00:12:53.730
Tsubasa-senpai is a girl,

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:57.440
but she seems so manly.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:12:59.170
Is this what it feels like to be in love?

00:12:59.380 --> 00:13:00.930
That's what got you?

00:13:00.930 --> 00:13:03.800
But I think they'll be helpful examples.

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:07.300
She's got such long arms and legs, 
her curves, her thighs...

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.930
That's what got you?

00:13:09.610 --> 00:13:13.370
By the way, Ruki-san and Tsubasa-san 
are next door, right?

00:13:13.370 --> 00:13:15.660
I'd love to see a professional's room.

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:16.550
I'm so curious!

00:13:16.550 --> 00:13:17.770
A professional's room...

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.590
Kaos-chan, let's go check it out.

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:26.820
What's up?

00:13:26.820 --> 00:13:30.640
We wanted to see what a 
professional's room looked like!

00:13:30.640 --> 00:13:31.530
Sure.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:33.040
Come on in.

00:13:35.190 --> 00:13:38.000
Tsubasa-san's desk looks like a 
professional manga artist's desk!

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:41.090
The shonen manga artist with a 
serialized series is so cool!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.350
You think so?

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:45.530
Tsu-chan's got a deadline tonight, 
so she's a bit frantic.

00:13:45.530 --> 00:13:46.770
<i>Deadline?</i>

00:13:46.770 --> 00:13:48.170
<i>Frantic?</i>

00:13:48.170 --> 00:13:49.550
<i>That's so professional!</i>

00:13:49.550 --> 00:13:52.300
And she's got a ponytail and glasses!

00:13:52.300 --> 00:13:53.810
Are you getting into work mode?

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.240
You're so wonderful!

00:13:55.240 --> 00:13:56.520
Y-You think so?

00:13:56.520 --> 00:13:58.400
Guts

00:13:58.930 --> 00:14:00.810
She draws por—

00:13:59.250 --> 00:14:00.810
Don't, Tsu-chan! It's a secret!

00:14:01.890 --> 00:14:03.810
Why are you looking under my bed?

00:14:04.250 --> 00:14:07.290
I don't see any dirty 
books or DVDs down there.

00:14:07.290 --> 00:14:09.320
I wonder what she does for research material.

00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:12.880
Ruki-san, what's this 
lewd school uniform for?

00:14:12.880 --> 00:14:13.950
Uh, for school?

00:14:13.950 --> 00:14:16.790
I just remembered rabbits mate a lot.

00:14:16.790 --> 00:14:18.270
Seriously, what?

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:22.370
Simply put, don't you have any pervy 
research material to draw pervy manga?

00:14:22.370 --> 00:14:23.300
Huh?!

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.950
Koyume-san, you shouldn't be so prejudiced!

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:29.300
Maybe Ruki-san is pervy enough that she 
doesn't actually need research materials!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.580
Kaos-chan, that's plenty rude, too...

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:34.000
It's hard to tell because 
she's wearing baggy clothes,

00:14:34.000 --> 00:14:36.180
but she's got huge boobs!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:36.890
Huh?

00:14:37.070 --> 00:14:40.040
I see! Let's have a feel!

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:42.430
Huh?

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:43.900
Ruki-san's pretty padded...

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:44.860
No! Stop!

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:47.110
What should I do?!

00:14:45.890 --> 00:14:47.110
Don't draw that!

00:14:47.660 --> 00:14:49.870
I'd say she's an A cup, at most.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:51.160
So small! How surprising!

00:14:51.160 --> 00:14:54.420
Is it so weird that I'd draw lewd 
manga when my boobs are small?!

00:14:54.420 --> 00:14:55.790
Well, is it?!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:56.410
No...

00:14:56.410 --> 00:14:57.710
We're sorry.

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:02.700
I just wanted to draw a laid-back 
manga about animals...

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.370
Really?

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:08.120
Rukki originally sent in a manga 
that was targeted to little kids.

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:09.970
What do you think?

00:15:09.970 --> 00:15:11.780
Your drawings look pretty mature,

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.600
so I'm going to introduce 
you to another magazine.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.340
The hotness in this is genius-level.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:18.280
You're excellent at drawing big boobs.

00:15:18.280 --> 00:15:20.370
Let's shoot for a serial 
with a big-boobed protagonist!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.310
What?!

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.940
And then they gave her the pen 
name Big Boobies ♥ Himeko.

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.810
Don't say that!

00:15:26.810 --> 00:15:29.410
I was really torn, at first,

00:15:29.650 --> 00:15:34.120
I always look forward to your manga, Himeko-sensei.
I hope I end up being as mature as you.
How can I be like you?
I love you and your manga. I'll continue to support you!
Please keep up the great work♥

00:15:30.310 --> 00:15:34.120
but I learned that there were a 
lot of fans who supported me.

00:15:35.590 --> 00:15:38.350
So now, it all seems worth it.

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:40.410
I see...

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:41.900
Big Boobies ♥...

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.370
...Himeko-sensei...

00:15:43.370 --> 00:15:46.380
Please forget my pen name immediately!

00:15:48.300 --> 00:15:52.100
But it's really cool that you got over your 
insecurities and got a serialized series.

00:15:54.050 --> 00:15:56.240
You think I'm cool?

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:57.970
Even though my boobs are small?

00:15:57.970 --> 00:15:59.930
That's even better!

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.790
Your eyes are all gleaming.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.750
Wait, sorry, Tsu-chan. 
You have a deadline...

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:05.890
W-We're sorry!

00:16:05.890 --> 00:16:06.900
Sorry!

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:08.390
No, it's fine.

00:16:08.870 --> 00:16:10.310
I'll help you out.

00:16:10.310 --> 00:16:11.430
Thanks.

00:16:11.430 --> 00:16:13.620
We always help each other 
out when we're busy.

00:16:13.830 --> 00:16:15.840
<i>Two professionals helping each other out...</i>

00:16:15.840 --> 00:16:19.780
<i>How wonderful! I want to help, too, but...</i>

00:16:19.780 --> 00:16:23.620
Um, if you wouldn't mind, 
we'd like to help, too.

00:16:23.620 --> 00:16:24.750
Th-That's right!

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:26.750
Very well.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.130
Are you sure, Tsu-chan?

00:16:28.450 --> 00:16:30.420
It's always helpful to have more people.

00:16:30.420 --> 00:16:32.400
Could you take care of this page?

00:16:32.400 --> 00:16:33.210
S-Sure!

00:16:33.390 --> 00:16:36.420
Unleash dark energy into this panel.

00:16:36.420 --> 00:16:37.260
Huh?!

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:42.730
You didn't think
I'd just let you get away...

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:40.900
Unleash dark energy into this panel.

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:42.830
Dark energy?

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:45.980
Wh-What should I do? 
I don't understand what she's saying!

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:49.860
And I need you to engrave the eternal 
black crest upon this panel.

00:16:49.860 --> 00:16:51.430
So use tone 83,

00:16:51.430 --> 00:16:53.460
scrape it up a bit, and 
then color the rest black.

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:54.450
You understood that?!

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:56.310
Wow, Koyume-chan!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:59.950
It even took me three months to realize 
what the heck Tsu-chan was talking about.

00:17:00.350 --> 00:17:02.080
<i>I don't understand any of it.</i>

00:17:02.530 --> 00:17:04.130
When I look into her eyes...

00:17:04.130 --> 00:17:07.410
I just... somehow understand!

00:17:07.410 --> 00:17:08.840
So girly!

00:17:09.060 --> 00:17:11.300
Could you apply screen tone here?

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:13.510
And white out this spot?

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:14.460
And...

00:17:15.100 --> 00:17:16.470
Stay by my side forever.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:18.500
That's...

00:17:18.500 --> 00:17:20.430
I don't think she said that!

00:17:36.980 --> 00:17:39.100
<i>Koyume-san works so fast.</i>

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:41.200
You're amazing, especially
for your first time assisting.

00:17:41.680 --> 00:17:43.330
I'm glad you came, Koyume.

00:17:44.190 --> 00:17:45.910
<i>She praised me!</i>

00:17:45.910 --> 00:17:48.000
<i>And even called me by my name!</i>

00:17:48.000 --> 00:17:50.960
Flowers are blooming in the battle scene!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:53.810
<i>Wh-What should I do?</i>

00:17:54.210 --> 00:17:56.880
<i>I have to work hard, too.</i>

00:17:56.880 --> 00:17:58.650
<i>I always work with digital,</i>

00:17:58.650 --> 00:18:00.900
<i>so it's taking me so long 
just to do the black fills.</i>

00:18:05.520 --> 00:18:07.650
<i>Everyone's so amazingly fast...</i>

00:18:07.650 --> 00:18:10.310
<i>I'm the only one who's slow.</i>

00:18:10.310 --> 00:18:11.510
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:14.980
<i>Just thinking about the fact that I can't 
mess up on this manuscript is making my hand...</i>

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.710
<i>I-I-It's okay!</i>

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.910
<i>I just need to correct it 
before anyone ever notices...</i>

00:18:26.940 --> 00:18:30.080
Ruki-san, your ponytail is
so comforting to look at.

00:18:30.560 --> 00:18:32.210
You're sweating profusely. Are you okay?

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:33.380
<i>No!</i>

00:18:33.380 --> 00:18:36.060
<i>The more I try to fix it, 
the worse the problem gets...</i>

00:18:36.060 --> 00:18:36.880
<i>I want to disappear.</i>

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.100
<i>This isn't forgivable, even if I apologize.</i>

00:18:39.100 --> 00:18:41.400
Kaos, could you do this page, too?

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:42.550
S-Sure!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:43.560
I'll never
forgive you!!

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:46.810
Kaos-chan?!

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:49.270
I thought it was taking you a while...

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.280
Your precious manuscript...

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:52.740
I'm so sorry...

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.900
Please just allow me enough 
time to write a will...

00:18:55.900 --> 00:18:57.740
Kaos-chan, you're taking 
this way too seriously!

00:18:57.910 --> 00:18:59.200
No problem.

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.010
Just you watch!

00:19:01.650 --> 00:19:03.660
Darkness Destruction!

00:19:03.660 --> 00:19:04.520
Huh?

00:19:04.160 --> 00:19:05.330
Tsubasa-senpai?

00:19:05.590 --> 00:19:07.790
Whenever Tsu-chan goes 
into concentration mode,

00:19:07.790 --> 00:19:10.300
she turns into one of her characters.

00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:11.800
That's amazing...

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:14.020
How wonderful! You're like a prince!

00:19:14.020 --> 00:19:15.290
I'm not a prince.

00:19:15.290 --> 00:19:18.640
I am the hero of darkness, born from demons—

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:20.250
Just hurry up and fix it.

00:19:20.250 --> 00:19:21.130
Roger that!

00:19:25.140 --> 00:19:25.890
Wow.

00:19:27.020 --> 00:19:28.510
Are you a god, Tsubasa-san?!

00:19:28.700 --> 00:19:31.190
A god, huh? Not a bad idea.

00:19:31.620 --> 00:19:33.890
I thought you were the hero of darkness.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:37.810
Huh?

00:19:38.720 --> 00:19:42.000
I can tell that you tried your best.

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:45.160
People like you grow, 
so you have nothing to worry about.

00:19:45.600 --> 00:19:48.050
Thank you for risking your life

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:50.540
on my manuscript that's more 
important than life itself.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:53.510
Tsubasha-shan...

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:56.550
I should've messed up more, too!

00:19:56.550 --> 00:19:57.960
Koyume-chan...

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.550
Tsu-chan, it's almost time!

00:20:01.920 --> 00:20:02.510
Time to get serious!

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:07.780
Tsubasa-san uses three-pen style?!

00:20:07.780 --> 00:20:09.430
Now she's three times faster!

00:20:09.430 --> 00:20:10.060
So fast!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:12.060
But sometimes, her movements 
seem to be hindered...

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.100
My cape and eyepatch are in the way!

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:15.100
She just admitted it!

00:20:15.400 --> 00:20:17.490
Okay, we need to hurry, too.

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:18.060
Right!

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:21.880
<i>I have to do my best.</i>

00:20:23.240 --> 00:20:25.440
<i>Everyone's concentrating so hard.</i>

00:20:25.440 --> 00:20:28.210
<i>They must all love drawing manga.</i>

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:35.820
<i>If I stay here, I might be able to 
become a proper manga artist.</i>

00:20:37.690 --> 00:20:39.210
What's wrong, Kaos-chan?

00:20:39.690 --> 00:20:40.600
It's nothing.

00:20:41.170 --> 00:20:42.170
I can do this!

00:20:44.770 --> 00:20:46.190
I did it again!

00:20:46.190 --> 00:20:47.150
It's okay.

00:20:47.150 --> 00:20:48.930
I'll quickly fix it up again!

00:20:48.930 --> 00:20:51.050
I'm sorry, Tsubasa-san.

00:20:51.050 --> 00:20:53.270
All because someone like me 
was trying to help you...

00:20:53.270 --> 00:20:55.040
You can whine after you finish!

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:56.520
R-Right!

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:21.670
Finished!

00:21:22.100 --> 00:21:25.820
I have a feeling that Tsubasa-san 
ended up doing most of the work...

00:21:25.820 --> 00:21:27.710
I'm sorry that I'm so useless.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:31.490
Wow, she's out like a light.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:36.020
She never snores. She must be really tired.

00:21:37.080 --> 00:21:38.100
Oh, Koyume-san.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:41.440
Moeta Japanese Sweets

00:21:38.350 --> 00:21:41.440
Manju

00:21:38.560 --> 00:21:41.680
Here. Some manju I brought from home.

00:21:41.680 --> 00:21:42.680
Thanks!

00:21:42.680 --> 00:21:44.150
They look delicious.

00:21:46.100 --> 00:21:47.490
<i>Tsubasa-san...</i>

00:21:47.490 --> 00:21:51.580
<i>She's strong and kind, like a 
protagonist of a shonen manga.</i>

00:21:52.230 --> 00:21:55.100
<i>I guess that's why she's able 
to draw such fun manga.</i>

00:21:56.020 --> 00:21:58.310
I'm the exact opposite.

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:02.160
I want to draw a protagonist who's 
cheerful and has a lot of friends,

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:05.550
but I only cause trouble for the people around me,

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:07.380
and I'll never have any friends...

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:10.880
Kaos-chan, your extremely dark 
internal monologue is spilling out.

00:22:10.880 --> 00:22:11.720
Huh?

00:22:11.720 --> 00:22:15.930
Not to mention, I already 
consider you a friend, Kaos-chan.

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:18.780
I-I couldn't possibly ask you to...

00:22:18.780 --> 00:22:21.470
I want to get to know you better, too.

00:22:22.570 --> 00:22:23.650
Ruki-san...

00:22:23.650 --> 00:22:27.030
We made it through this battlefield 
together, my comrade...

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:29.980
Tsubasa-san, but you're asleep...

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:32.980
Th-This is like a dream.

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:36.310
I'm so happy, I don't know what to do...

00:22:37.250 --> 00:22:40.900
Oh! Is it okay if I go tell my mom back home?

00:22:41.310 --> 00:22:42.380
Sure, go ahead.

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:44.750
Kaos-sensei made human friends
for the first time in her life

00:22:42.370 --> 00:22:44.750
Kaos

00:22:42.500 --> 00:22:44.750
Maybe on the border of my manga, too!

00:22:45.190 --> 00:22:47.010
Yeah, you probably shouldn't.

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:58.640
I'll do my best...

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:07.280
I've made friends!

00:23:07.280 --> 00:23:08.740
I see.

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:11.160
Looks like going to that 
dorm was the right choice.

00:23:11.160 --> 00:23:12.160
Yes!

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.830
I feel like I'll be able to 
draw lots of interesting manga.

00:23:16.600 --> 00:23:18.790
I hate to say this right now,

00:23:18.790 --> 00:23:22.920
but your most recent storyboard was really 
boring, so we won't be moving forward with it.

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:28.510
I'm sorry I made things so awkward!

00:23:30.510 --> 00:23:32.050
I feel like the protagonist!

00:23:32.260 --> 00:23:34.300
To the dungeon where 
the legendary item resides!

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:36.060
Wait! Please wait!

00:23:36.010 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:39.520
Next time, "I Start School Today."

00:23:36.100 --> 00:23:40.020
I Start School Today
